     "titleKo": "섹션 11 (AMDD 11) — 진단·측정 기능이 있는 의료기기 · Section 11(2) (AMDD 11.2)",
     "summaryEn": "A diagnostic medical device shall be designed and manufactured in such a way as to provide sufficient accuracy, precision and stability for its intended use, based on appropriate scientific and technical methods; in particular the design shall address sensitivity, specificity, trueness, repeatability, reproducibility, control of known relevant interference and limits of detection, as appropriate.",
     "summaryKo": "진단 의료기기는 적절한 과학적·기술적 방법에 근거하여 의도된 용도에 충분한 정확도·정밀도·안정성을 제공하도록 설계·제조되어야 하며, 특히 설계는 민감도, 특이도, 정확성(trueness), 반복성, 재현성, 알려진 관련 간섭의 관리, 검출한계를 적절히 다루어야 한다.",
