     "summaryEn": "Reports of clinical investigations conducted specifically with the device to be regularised with ANVISA must be presented as proof of safety and efficacy in these situations:\n(I) devices with innovations in design, raw material, indication of use, among others, regardless of risk class;\n(II) Class III and IV devices that, owing to their unique nature and performance closely tied to material design and manufacturing process, require verification of safety and efficacy using clinical data specific to the device under evaluation.",
