     "titleKo": "조정·교정·유지보수",
     "summaryEn": "Devices and IVDs must be designed and manufactured so that adjustment, calibration and maintenance can be done safely and effectively. Specifically where maintenance is not possible, risks of ageing of materials, among others, must be adequately reduced (§1). Where adjustment and calibration are not possible, risks of loss of accuracy of any measuring or control mechanism must be adequately reduced (§2).",
     "summaryKo": "기기·IVD는 조정·교정·유지보수를 안전하고 효과적으로 수행할 수 있도록 설계·제조해야 한다. 특히 유지보수가 불가능한 경우 재료 노화 등의 위험을 적절히 줄이고(§1), 조정·교정이 불가능한 경우 측정·제어 기구의 정확도 상실 위험을 적절히 줄여야 한다(§2).",
